    "title": "Lyon County approves $44.3 million budget for 2027 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By The Emporia Gazette ,\n11 hours ago Lyon County commissioners approved a $44.3 million budget for 2027 Thursday, certifying a spending plan expected to collect about $25.1 million in property taxes while remaining at the revenue-neutral rate. The vote followed a public hearing and discussion of the county’s largest expenses, including employee wages and benefits, road maintenance... Read full article\n1",
